WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.968
A word's grammatical role, surrounding clues and relationships with other words can

00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:06.557
help determine its meaning.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:12.201
“Ama was relieved when she found her missing key.” Relieved means what? Answer: No

00:00:12.201 --> 00:00:12.892
longer worried

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.760
Use context to explain a noun, a verb and an adjective from an unfamiliar reading

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:19.097
passage.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.489
Why it works: Finding the key removes worry.
